  imply endorsement.

  AWS and Microsoft Azure marks are NOT included. Both were removed from Simple
  Icons at the trademark owners' request, so Converge renders a lettermark in
  the official brand colour instead. If you hold the rights to use those marks,
  add the path data to src/views/brand-icons.local.js — it overrides the
  lettermark automatically and is not committed with any vendor artwork.

